    "neighborhood": "The full 37-site SUSAN mask: center plus 36 non-center samples over rows with widths 3,5,7,7,7,5,3.",
    "border": "No border extension; the source scans only centers with the complete mask and leaves unmarked source pixels unchanged.",
    "output_encoding": "Raw row-major 8-bit grayscale pixel plane from the source's same-dimension P5 output; omit the P5 text header.",
